  "Description": "Deploy a Gateway Load Balancer, Check Point CloudGuard IaaS Security Gateway Auto Scaling Group, and optionally a Security Management Server, in a new VPC (20260623).\nSee CloudGuard Network for AWS Gateway Load Balancer Auto Scaling Group deployment guide for detailed deployment and configuration steps.\n",
